{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":193,"count":30,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-26\",\"厨房\",\"廚房\",\"厨房\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家的廚房很大，我常常在家做飯。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā de chúfáng hěn dà, wǒ chángcháng zài jiā zuòfàn.","english":"My kitchen is quite big, I often cook at home.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-26","sourceFront":"廚房","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我很忙，現在要去廚房做飯，你再去房間找吧。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn máng, xiànzài yào qù chúfáng zuòfàn, nǐ zài qù fángjiān zhǎo ba.","english":"I am very busy and I am going to the kitchen to cook now. You go check your room again.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L06-3-13\",\"比赛\",\"比賽\",\"比赛\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天下午學校有籃球比賽，我們去看吧！","pinyin":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ xuéxiào yǒu lánqiú bǐsài, wǒmen qù kàn ba!","english":"There is a basketball game at school this afternoon. Let’s go watch it!","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-13","sourceFront":"比賽","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-03\",\"讲\",\"講\",\"讲\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"知道，友美跟我講過。","pinyin":"Zhīdào, Yǒuměi gēn wǒ jiǎng guò.","english":"Yes, Youmei told me already.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-38\",\"打分数\",\"打分數\",\"打分数\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-24\",\"管理\",\"管理\",\"管理\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我父親是保險公司的經理，要管理很多員工。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-25","sourceFront":"員工","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"孔子希望君王能夠接受他的建議來管理國家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-12","sourceFront":"君王","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔子希望君王能夠接受他的建議來管理國家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-13","sourceFront":"接受","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"擔任這家公司的主管真不容易，不僅要管理整個部門的員工，還要達成老闆的工作要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-23","sourceFront":"主管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然藍先生是大學的校長，可是他很謙虛，經常向同事請教管理學校的方法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-12","sourceFront":"謙虛","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你既然把工廠交給他，就得放手讓他去管理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-01","sourceFront":"放手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據本大樓的管理規定，私人物品不可堆在公共區域。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-25","sourceFront":"私人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳統私立高中有許多規定，在管理學生方面相當嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-10","sourceFront":"私立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-01\",\"舉辦\",\"舉辦\",\"举办\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"高雄是台灣南部最大的城市，舉辦過世界運動會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-01","sourceFront":"舉辦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在德國舉辦的歐洲足球比賽，一共有十二個國家報名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-30","sourceFront":"報名","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"超商常舉辦送小禮物或買一送一的活動，可是對王先生完全沒有吸引力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-10","sourceFront":"完全","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"世界運動會的規模很大，每回舉辦時，五大洲的國家都會來參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-08","sourceFront":"規模","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次社區的中秋節活動，決定在戶外舉辦，萬一下雨了就搬到室內去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老闆舉辦了一個免費吃鬆餅的活動，目的是調查哪種口味的鬆餅最受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-10","sourceFront":"調查","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺北美術館最近舉辦了很有名的畫展，吸引了很多民眾去欣賞那些畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-16","sourceFront":"欣賞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們全家都是信基督教的，不論教會舉辦什麼活動，我們都一定去參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-12","sourceFront":"教會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店時常在過節時舉辦降價活動來吸引顧客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-07","sourceFront":"過節","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他希望能在海邊舉辦婚禮，可是一直找不到理想的場地。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-07","sourceFront":"場地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-23\",\"交流\",\"交流\",\"交流\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"出國留學有很多好處，除了學習語言，還有文化交流的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-23","sourceFront":"交流","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校蓋了一棟活動中心，學生又多了一個交流、休閒的好場所了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-06","sourceFront":"蓋","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們大學前年起已開放跨校選課，增加各校的交流機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-27","sourceFront":"跨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸福的婚姻不僅需要觀念的溝通，更需要感情的交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-45","sourceFront":"婚姻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們特地到當地的滑雪用品工廠參觀，並進行技術交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-16","sourceFront":"技術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-42\",\"一时\",\"一時\",\"一时\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天中文口試時我太緊張了，一時不知道怎麼回答，所以成績不太好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-42","sourceFront":"一時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"聽說經理後天就要離開公司了。 這個消息太突然了，大家一時沒辦法接受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-04","sourceFront":"突然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次地震的規模很大，連總統一時也很難掌握各地的災情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-08","sourceFront":"掌握","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-17\",\"满足\",\"滿足\",\"满足\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路商店滿足了人們購物的需求，就是不出門，也可買到各式各樣的生活用品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-08","sourceFront":"可","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-23\",\"情侣\",\"情侶\",\"情侣\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那對情侶因為不了解而在一起，沒想到最後因為了解而分開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-36","sourceFront":"分開","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"結婚之前，那對情侶認真規劃了未來的生活，沒想到結婚一個月之後就離婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-25","sourceFront":"之前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"情侶之間如果無法相信彼此，很容易就分手了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-16","sourceFront":"彼此","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-1-19\",\"运气\",\"運氣\",\"运气\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那所非常有名的大學每年只錄取一千名新生，除了得成績夠好，還需要一點兒運氣才進得去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-19","sourceFront":"錄取","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他這幾年因為投資生意發了，婚姻生活也很幸福，運氣非常好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-31","sourceFront":"發","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他贏了這次選舉只是運氣好罷了，其實他沒什麼能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-01","sourceFront":"罷了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"迷信的人老是相信一些不真實的迷信，例如：黑貓會帶來不好的運氣、送傘給情人就會分手什麼的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-11","sourceFront":"迷信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據華人民間的說法，過年時如果收到紅包，整年就會有好運氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-23","sourceFront":"民間","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L05-2-10\",\"灾情\",\"災情\",\"灾情\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這次強烈地震造成了嚴重的災情，不但許多房屋塌了，連橋也斷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-10","sourceFront":"災情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次地震的規模很大，連總統一時也很難掌握各地的災情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-08","sourceFront":"掌握","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-33\",\"至於\",\"至於\",\"至于\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我知道那輛德國汽車很貴，至於到底多貴，我就不清楚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-33","sourceFront":"至於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 至(reach) and 於(at): 至於 means as to."},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-09\",\"爱\",\"愛\",\"爱\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個孩子很愛踢足球。","pinyin":"Nà ge háizi hěn ài tī zúqiú.","english":"That kid loves to play soccer very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-07","sourceFront":"踢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我爸爸、媽媽有三個孩子，我最愛看書。","pinyin":"Wǒ bàba, māma yǒu sān ge háizi, wǒ zuì ài kànshū.","english":"My parents have three kids. I like to read the most.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-21","sourceFront":"最","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我愛吃水果。","pinyin":"Wǒ ài chī shuǐguǒ.","english":"I love eating fruit.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-3-05","sourceFront":"水果","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我愛你。","pinyin":"Wǒ ài nǐ.","english":"I love you.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-3-03","sourceFront":"愛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"新同學很可愛。","pinyin":"Xīn tóngxué hěn kěài.","english":"The new classmate is lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-08","sourceFront":"可愛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"燈籠上的小老虎好可愛。","pinyin":"Dēnglóng shàng de xiǎo lǎohǔ hǎo kě'ài.","english":"The little tiger on the lantern is so lovely.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很多年輕男生愛在書店看汽車雜誌，汽車很貴，他們不一定可以買新車，可是都看得很開心。","pinyin":"Hěn duō niánqīng nánshēng ài zài shūdiàn kàn qìchē zázhì, qìchē hěn guì, tāmen bù yídìng kěyǐ mǎi xīn chē, kěshì dōu kàn de hěn kāixīn.","english":"Many young men like to read car magazines at bookstores. Cars are expensive and they don’t usually have the money to buy new ones; however, they are very happy just by reading those magazines.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"太好了！我最愛吃牛肉麵。他們也賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Wǒ zuì ài chī niúròu miàn. Tāmen yě mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"That is awesome! Beef noodles is my favorite. Do they sell drinks as well?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很可愛，友美喜歡可愛的東西。","pinyin":"Hěn kěài. Yǒuměi xǐhuān kěài de dōngxi.","english":"It’s very cute. Youmei likes cute stuff.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"友美愛看書，我想送她兩本中文書，你呢？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi ài kànshū, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā liǎng běn Zhōngwén shū, nǐ ne?","english":"Youmei loves reading. I would like to give her two books in Chinese as a gift. How about you?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"她是新同學，叫友美。她很可愛。","pinyin":"Tā shì xīn tóngxué, jiào Yǒuměi. Tā hěn kěài.","english":"She is our new classmate. Her name is Youmei. She is cute.","sourceCardId":"B1L01-1-01","sourceFront":"新","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-15\",\"口音\",\"口音\",\"口音\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他說的華語帶點兒家鄉口音，聽起來很親切。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-15","sourceFront":"口音","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他是華僑，說中文時常帶點兒當地的口音。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-06","sourceFront":"華僑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-53\",\"老實說\",\"老實說\",\"老实说\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-17\",\"用具\",\"用具\",\"用具\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"廚師們都會好好保養他們的用具，以免影響做菜的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-17","sourceFront":"用具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"從前有很多生活用具都是用銅做的，像銅杯、銅碗什麼的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-09","sourceFront":"銅","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-07\",\"左右\",\"左右\",\"左右\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"感冒要是一個星期左右還沒好，就應該去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-07","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們應該培養獨立思考的能力，別被身邊各種訊息左右。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-23","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國立博物館正在展覽公元三百年左右的古文物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-01","sourceFront":"公元","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-03\",\"志願\",\"志願\",\"志愿\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從小時候起，他的第一志願就是當一位保護國家的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-03","sourceFront":"志願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-11\",\"迷信\",\"迷信\",\"迷信\",\"N/Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"迷信的人老是相信一些不真實的迷信，例如：黑貓會帶來不好的運氣、送傘給情人就會分手什麼的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-11","sourceFront":"迷信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-12\",\"箭\",\"箭\",\"箭\",\"N/M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"射箭看來容易，但想把箭射好，就得辛苦地練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-12","sourceFront":"箭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"擲標槍、射箭、開槍(to shoot)需要的技巧都不同，想熟練就得多連練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-06","sourceFront":"槍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-2-31\",\"恐怖\",\"恐怖\",\"恐怖\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"播\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 扌(hand) takes its turn with the 番(turn) of seeds, scattering them to play. → 播(play)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"水平\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 水(water) and 平(flat): 水平 means level."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"火車\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"火(fire) + 車(vehicle) → the fire-powered vehicle: 火車 is a train."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"箱子\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A handy item for 箱(box) with suffix 子(child): 箱子 means box."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"維\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 糹(silk) thread ties the 隹(bird) fast, keeping it safe → 維(preserve)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"身上\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 身(body) and 上(above): 身上 means body."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"適合\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"When qualities 適(match) perfectly and 合(combine): 適合 means fit, suitable."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"雙數\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 雙(double) and 數(count): 雙數 means even number."}]}
